/ Before "Accept": the same purchase may have been photographed twice (a fiscal receipt and its card slip). A
/ warning with links, never a block (Receipt::DuplicateCheck). A bank transaction for it is "Book as" above.
- if check.any?
  = render "ui/callout", tone: :signal do
    .space-y-2.text-sm role="status"
      p
        strong Possibly photographed twice.
        |  Another receipt not booked yet has the same date and total as this one as saved:
      ul.list-disc.pl-5
        - check.receipts.each do |other|
          li
            = link_to receipt_label(other), receipt_path(other), data: { turbo_prefetch: false }
            = " · #{receipt_kind_label(other)} · not booked yet · #{receipt_money(other.total, other.currency)}"
      p.text-ink-muted Two equal purchases on one day happen too: accept if this is a different one.
